// Compile check for the whole rimelight_ui component library. Every exported component of every file in
// ui/components is imported and placed once in CheckWindow, so the Slint compiler type-checks all of them.
// The app has no real UI: CheckWindow exists only so build.rs compiles the markup and tests can create it.
// Generated from the export list; regenerate it when a component is added or renamed.

